   "page": 18,
   "category": "control",
   "text": "PowerView® Automation \nIncredible Convenience\nAchieve your perfect light automatically—morning, noon and night\nEffortless Control\nCompatible with voice assistants and many home  \nautomation systems*\nPrivacy and Security\nSchedule shadings to move automatically, when you’re  \nhome or away\nEnergy Efficiency \nProgram shadings to be in the best positions to heat and  \ncool your home\nChild and Pet Safety\nSimple, cord-free operation\nFlexible Power Options\nChoose from several power options, including a rechargeable  \nbattery and hardwiring capability\n* \u0007Some features require additional hardware and/or third-party equipment. \nTo learn more, visit hunterdouglas.com/powerview-design-options.  \nFor more details on PowerView Automation, open the opposite page.\n  \nFabric ClearView® Satin    Color Black Onyx\nControl Option PowerView® Automation     \nControl Options\nUltraGlide®\nA single retractable wand for enhanced child  \nsafety. With one click, the fabric panel drops for \ncomplete privacy. Pump the wand to open the \nvanes or raise the shading.\nSoftTouch® Motorization\nA battery-operated, cordless system. Gently  \npull down on the wand to lower shadings,  \nor lightly push up to raise them.\nEasyRise™\nA continuous cordless loop system. Simply pull \non the cord to raise or lower the shade. \n*Not available in Canada.",
