   "text": "The bottom fabric panel is adjusted to accommodate the height of the shading and allow for top to bottom vane alignment.\nBottom Fabric Panel Variance\nSmall Bottom Fabric Panel Variance\nLarge Bottom Fabric Panel Variance\nZero Bottom Panel \nThis optional feature for outside mount only,  \ntransforms the bottom panel into a functioning  \nvane. This may add up to 5\" to the length of  \nthe shading. \nFabric Avant    Color Beryl\nControl Option PowerView® Automation \nThe height of the bottom fabric panel will be between 0\" and 5\". This height cannot \nbe predicted until the shade is in manufacturing. \n•  With identical height measurements\n•  At the same time\n•  With the same fabric and vane size\n•  With the same mounting style\nTo ensure shadings are fabricated with bottom fabric panels of the same  \nheight, they must be ordered: \nBOTTOM FABRIC  \nPANEL VARIANCE",
